# Bandit Level 14 → Level 15

## Goal
The password for the next level can be retrieved by submitting the password of the current level to port 30000 on localhost

## Commands used
whoami
cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit14
nc localhost 30000

## Explanation
- 'whoami' tells me who I am login as
- ' cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit14 ' give me the password from the previous level 
- ' nc localhost 3000 ' nc stands for netcat and it allows me to connect to port 30000 on the localhost

## Result
After I put in the password of the previous level to enter port 30000 I was confirmed with a 'correct' and it gave me the password for level 15 

## What I learned
I learnt the use case of netcat when changing to a different port.
